Magic (or blessed) fountains can, if your luck is good, restore
ability, up to the power of a blessed potion of restore ability,
and gain ability, again up to the power of a blessed potion of
gain ability. I never quaff until I have a blessed luckstone and
have maxed my luck, it REALLY maxes your stats fast. If you don't
have good luck, it's just like a normal fountain. Once the magic
fountain works, it becomes normal. I think that's all.


